{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周之四月，即今之二月。下文二月十\n五佛滅，即今之十二月。以周朝用建子之月為正，異乎今之世也。辨此委如北山錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "莊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸文或云\n三年，或云六年〔，下〕十年丁卯，或云七年，並誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瑜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云三年者，誤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音戶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音迭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097001", "type": "orig", "text": "也一作世"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097002", "type": "orig", "text": "通疑道"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097003", "type": "orig", "text": "淑一作敘"}
{"id": null, "n": "0098001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0098001", "type": "orig", "text": "使疑便"}
{"id": null, "n": "0098002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0098002", "type": "orig", "text": "下疑或"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099001", "type": "orig", "text": "臣下一有矣字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099002", "type": "orig", "text": "四一作三"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099003", "type": "orig", "text": "咸一作成"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099004", "type": "orig", "text": "地一作也"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099005", "type": "orig", "text": "微一作徵"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099006", "type": "orig", "text": "吏一作史"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099007", "type": "orig", "text": "墮疑隳"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100001", "type": "orig", "text": "子下一有孔子二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100002", "type": "orig", "text": "徒字勘更"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100003", "type": "orig", "text": "之一作文"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100004", "type": "orig", "text": "載下一有之字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100005", "type": "orig", "text": "訓一作要"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100006", "type": "orig", "text": "仰一作夫"}
